{"about_the_game":"2.5D fantasy adventure homage to  &quot;The Little Prince &quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25fe\ufe0f Synopsis<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA small, barren star which has lost the Lord. A boy who abandoned his world and came to become a new \u201ckeeper\u201d for the little star. A small star that changes seasons with the hands of a young man, &quot;Geard&quot;, who is the previous keeper and the boy touches the memories of the people and things left behind there.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Even if you go far away.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25fe\ufe0f Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb Focused on scenario, and there is very few puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb 2.5D world consisting of 3D sphere model and pixel art.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbAn adventure game that you can play by manipulating characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb A Fantastic world view with subtle original graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb A world view / scenario homage to \u201cThe Little Prince\u201d <br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduction tool: Unity<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay time: about 2 hours<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNumber of EDs: 1 (There is no big branch, and if you handle all the sub-events, an extra scene will be added.)","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1174300?t=1770548017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1174300?t=1770548017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174300/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770548017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174300/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770548017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"2.5D fantasy adventure homage to  &quot;The Little Prince &quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25fe\ufe0f Synopsis<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA small, barren star which has lost the Lord. A boy who abandoned his world and came to b